That is awesome.

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.929
We love you, State Farm.
Thank you for doing that.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:30.997
That is so cool.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.598
So please,
give whatever you can.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:33.966
